// APW-4 -- Distinct-count cap -- BUGGY, permit form.
//
// permit-form (see apw2-permit-buggy.dw for the default-deny rationale).
//
// Counts *settled* (response) events; a burst of in-flight sends to distinct
// recipients is admitted before any settles, so the `<= 3` cap is not
// enforced. The one-word bug vs. the correct variant: `response` vs.
// `request`.
@id("apw4_permit_buggy")
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Send",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    (count for (t: Timepoint). where (
        formerly within 1h (Drupe::Action::"Send"::response{ input.recipient: context.input.recipient } && tp(t))
    )) <= 3
};
